OL,3,GNEWSAMan 'paid for terrible decision
OL,4,Awith his life', inquest told
OL,5,
OL,6,FAn inquest jury has found that a man
OL,7,Fdied after drink-driving at speeds of
OL,8,Fmore than 70mph before he crashed into
OL,9,Fa pub in Heywood, Greater Manchester.
OL,11,FWill Place, 23, had been drinking in
OL,12,FRochdale after watching the England vs
OL,13,FSlovakia match at Euro 2024 and got
OL,14,Fbehind the wheel of his car in the
OL,15,Fearly hours of Monday 1st July 2024.
OL,17,FWhen police in a marked van saw him
OL,18,Fpass a red light on Manchester Road,
OL,19,Fthey immediately began following him at
OL,20,Fhigh speed - but officers called off
OL,21,Fthe pursuit shortly before Mr Place
OL,22,Fcollided into the White Lion pub.
OL,23,APub: 22-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NW Eng NewsC Reg TVF Weather
FL,409,400,260,160,0,100
