OL,3,GNEWSAMan 'paid for terrible decision
OL,4,Awith his life', inquest told
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe narrative verdict made no mention
OL,7,Fabout the conduct of police officers
OL,8,Fwho had responded to the incident in
OL,9,Fthe moments before the fatal crash.
